<title>HONG KONG: Yugang Int'l interim net up 102.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Yugang Int'l interim net up 102.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   14.3     vs 7.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0	vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs 13.09 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    52.43    vs 25.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,314.30 vs 400.26</p>
<p>    Company name		 Yugang International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 1-4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Yugang is a raw materials and audio-visual and industrial products trading firm.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
